=Shop listing: {{ $json.store_title }}
Amazon listing: {{ $json.amazon_title }}

Are these the same product? Generation, capacity and pack size have to match. Retail titles are not written to match each other, so where one title gives a detail the other leaves out - a colour, a bundled accessory, a marketing phrase - treat that as compatible. Only answer no when the two actually conflict, when a title is missing, or when one is an accessory for the other.

